    interpreter_same_name_class_method_dispatch_collision_2026_11_26, 0, "2026-11-26 seed /home/yoon/.cache/cargo-target-wr-seed1126b/release/simple, aarch64: with the legacy import the spec fails 'rejects an unresolved struct field', 'rejects unresolved aggregate construction writes and GEP', 'rejects missing nested wrong kind and cyclic by value layouts'; a copy without the legacy import passes all three. Exact dispatch site not yet located (file column is a candidate, not a diagnosis)."

